+# AV-5m2 (grok)
+
+Base: `633eb99` (`cc/living-library` including AV-5m1). File: `library_mirror.py`.
+No commit, push, model, paid API, live index, or port 5179. Acceptance tests unedited.
+`librarian_apply_enabled` remains false.
+
+## Repairs
+
+- **D12** — pending temp records survive a new intent generation; delete only when path is contained and current bytes match the recorded hash.
+- **D13** — timed-out vault workers are interrupted, destination exclusion is held while they remain inflight, and dest is not rolled back after replace.
+- **D14** — `Library.md` intent hash is written from the exact bytes about to be replaced.
+- **D15** — destination-binding persistence errors propagate; binding is written before acknowledgement; missing/corrupt binding requires reconciliation.
+
+## Commands and counts
+
+Python 3.14, `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`, `PYTHONPATH=<worktree>;<user site-packages>`, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` absent, disposable `APPDATA`/`TEMP`, short `--basetemp` under `_scratch/`. Unit `tmp_path` shortened with the AW-3 `mktemp("t")` plugin (long pytest node names exceed the mirror's 240-character path cap in this worktree).
+
+| Command | Result |
+|---|---|
+| `pytest tests/library_work_astra/test_phase4_aw3_acceptance.py -k "d12 or d13 or d14 or d15"` | 8 passed, 9 deselected |
+| `pytest tests/library_work_astra/test_phase4_aw3_acceptance.py` | **17 passed** (D01–D03, D07–D10 retained) |
+| `pytest …/test_phase4_aw_acceptance.py …/test_phase4_aw2_acceptance.py …/test_phase4_aw3_acceptance.py` | **77 passed** (32+28+17) in 20.71 s |
+| `pytest tests/test_library_resources.py tests/test_library_prompts.py tests/test_library_briefs.py tests/test_library_mirror.py tests/test_library_mirror_wiring.py tests/test_phase4_stdio.py tests/test_c01_mcp_stdio.py` | **133 passed** in 26.28 s |
+
+Limitation: a hung `os.replace` syscall is not abortable until it returns; the attempt is not acknowledged. Per-replace child processes were tried and dropped — they exceeded the 2 s budget on Windows.
